    {
      "id": "n-90b94ec50e74",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 08 Challenges and Gap Analysis\n\nRisk chain from challenge to impact, verification, mitigation and decision.\n\n**Status labels are part of the content; color is not the only status signal.**",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-33e3dae7fd3f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## People\n\n**Challenge**\nOwnership unclear\n\n**Potential impact**\nDisputed results\n\n**Verify** RACI interview\n**Mitigate** Governance role\n\n**BA ASSESSMENT / TO VERIFY**",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-d8074197670c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Process\n\n**Challenge**\nLifecycle inconsistent\n\n**Potential impact**\nDrift / rework\n\n**Verify** Walkthrough\n**Mitigate** Controlled catalogue\n\n**BA ASSESSMENT / TO VERIFY**",
      "x": 670,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-b9f971f4d2ea",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Data\n\n**Challenge**\nEvidence/source unclear\n\n**Potential impact**\nNon-auditable score\n\n**Verify** Source trace\n**Mitigate** Ownership / lineage\n\n**BA ASSESSMENT / TO VERIFY**",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-4bc96384627d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## System\n\n**Challenge**\nTOP capability unknown\n\n**Potential impact**\nWrong solution choice\n\n**Verify** WP01/WP06\n**Mitigate** Options analysis\n\n**BA ASSESSMENT / TO VERIFY**",
      "x": 1910,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-03a8bf163622",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Governance\n\n**Challenge**\nRoll-up rules unapproved\n\n**Potential impact**\nBias / double count\n\n**Verify** Golden cases\n**Mitigate** Approved controls\n\n**BA ASSESSMENT / TO VERIFY**",
      "x": 2530,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "1"
    },
